abstract: >-
  Official US list prices of every Raspberry Pi board, Compute Module and Pico since 2012, all announced price
  changes including the memory-driven rounds of 2025/26, and the production guarantees of 45 Raspberry Pi
  products, each with its primary source on raspberrypi.com.
keywords:
  - Raspberry Pi
  - single-board computers
  - prices
  - product lifecycle
  - obsolescence
  - time series
